### Confronta 3 ricette — atteso 200
POST {{DrNutrizioNino_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/recipes/compare
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "items": [
    { "recipeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001", "quantityGrams": 150 },
    { "recipeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002", "quantityGrams": 200 },
    { "recipeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003", "quantityGrams": 100 }
  ]
}

